f\">glm(formula = CW ~ P1 + P2 + P3 + P4 + P5 + P6 + P7 + P8 + P9 +</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\">\r\n<font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">    P10 + P11 + P12, family = quasibinomial)</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">Deviance Residuals:</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">     Min        1Q    Median        3Q       Max</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">-1.31495  -0.07362  -0.00913  -0.00317   0.31917</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">Coefficients: (8 not defined because of singularities)</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\">\r\n<font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">             Estimate Std. Error t value Pr(&gt;|t|)</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">(Intercept)    -13.19      40.62  -0.325   0.7515</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">P1                 NA         NA      NA       NA</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\">\r\n<font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">P2             792.00  157999.74   0.005   0.9961</font></div><div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">P3                 NA         NA      NA       NA</font></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:start\"><font color=\"#0c343d\" face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">P4             319.36   41536.58   0.008   0.9940</font></div><div style=\"text-